  "//vps": "Optional. When set, the box's :3333 terminal sessions show up in a 'VPS' section of the sidebar and can be driven from here. The token stays on this Mac - it is proxied server-side and never reaches the browser. Copy this file to mts-config.json (git-ignored) and fill in the real token.",
